<div class="section" id="executive-overview">
  <h2>1. Executive Overview</h2>
  <p>This report analyzes 12,343 data points spanning 10 job roles across 6 countries from 2015 to 2035, examining how AI automation risk, compensation, skill demand, and job survival prospects are evolving. The findings reveal a job market undergoing significant structural transformation, with clear winners and losers emerging by role, geography, and skill set.</p>

