  <p>Average skill demand scores are relatively uniform (78.9–79.9), but trends and correlations with survival tell a more nuanced story. Java and Excel show the highest absolute demand scores, yet Excel is tied to the highest-risk role (Business Analyst). Deep Learning, Python, and Security skills correlate with the strongest survival outcomes.</p>

